      "dcterms:format": "application/json",
      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:ac5a4264543fced1dabdf7c37c08e78dd0690b6a7ca554508c3d1f4fe75a1df8\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:1c3ab3a8e87891b6b1d928fa5d9cc1a63ff9f3efac26d82856b3450e3a62a561\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:d90d9efdfe7c20b62d4f6de131a4bdbb91e08967cf138b085d6c929124f2cfbb\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:af974ab314f01ba624c8c0ddabb0b053933504373d8c4719e0dc20b84065af7c\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:cc9e8e3a5d8a062646199c63c39dd788d9efb66746e4e75971524c5b7676c69c\"],\"choice_quote\":\"\",\"choice_text\":\"\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[\"(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\",\"(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\"],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":5933,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":5933,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:5370:5933:sha256-47eba493b53486ba093d7a6299a7e50e0816dd5ddeb5de830bd5be07e6f5395c\",\"quote\":\"(d) The determination of whether an employee meets the hours of service requirement and has been employed by the employer for a total of at least 12 months must be made as of the date the FMLA leave is to start. An employee may be on non-FMLA leave at the time he or she meets the 12-month eligibility requirement, and in that event, any portion of the leave taken for an FMLA-qualifying reason after the employee meets the eligibility requirement would be FMLA leave. See § 825.300(b) for rules governing the content of the eligibility notice given to employees.\",\"start\":5370},{\"end\":5933,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:5370:5933:sha256-47eba493b53486ba093d7a6299a7e50e0816dd5ddeb5de830bd5be07e6f5395c\",\"quote\":\"(d) The determination of whether an employee meets the hours of service requirement and has been employed by the employer for a total of at least 12 months must be made as of the date the FMLA leave is to start. An employee may be on non-FMLA leave at the time he or she meets the 12-month eligibility requirement, and in that event, any portion of the leave taken for an FMLA-qualifying reason after the employee meets the eligibility requirement would be FMLA leave. See § 825.300(b) for rules governing the content of the eligibility notice given to employees.\",\"start\":5370},{\"end\":5530,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:5526:5530:sha256-4137b01e139589b7a1d3b3fc4da031d8ce5bb415808734e970c3a58ea0e98f0f\",\"quote\":\"must\",\"start\":5526},{\"end\":5933,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:5370:5933:sha256-47eba493b53486ba093d7a6299a7e50e0816dd5ddeb5de830bd5be07e6f5395c\",\"quote\":\"(d) The determination of whether an employee meets the hours of service requirement and has been employed by the employer for a total of at least 12 months must be made as of the date the FMLA leave is to start. An employee may be on non-FMLA leave at the time he or she meets the 12-month eligibility requirement, and in that event, any portion of the leave taken for an FMLA-qualifying reason after the employee meets the eligibility requirement would be FMLA leave. See § 825.300(b) for rules governing the content of the eligibility notice given to employees.\",\"start\":5370},{\"end\":170,\"field\":\"context:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:105:170:sha256-65892c2f4a4b04b4af78de1dd2934ed6701e42ce507cd493e35ac4d9a1ba80b0\",\"quote\":\"(1) Has been employed by the employer for at least 12 months, and\",\"start\":105},{\"end\":406,\"field\":\"context:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aa4cdfc9b75c8a1ed78c29b8a344913757e4b95198a4b069127aa9092960aaf4f:172:406:sha256-f8c620c940dc57284f54426aad3bc219080834d541b71563d59c69ce9eeffe60\",\"quote\":\"(2) Has been employed for at least 1,250 hours of service during the 12-month period immediately preceding the commencement of the leave ( see § 825.801 for special hours of service requirements for airline flight crew employees), and\",\"start\":172}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:bc18afeeee1c99c72882a18ff1f81fc4d68c550cc2bc9bafa3055145def8be95\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"(d) The determination of whether an employee meets the hours of service requirement and has been employed by the employer for a total of at least 12 months must be made as of the date the FMLA leave is to start. An employee may be on non-FMLA leave at the time he or she meets the 12-month eligibility requirement, and in that event, any portion of the leave taken for an FMLA-qualifying reason after the employee meets the eligibility requirement would be FMLA leave. See § 825.300(b) for rules governing the content of the eligibility notice given to employees.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:cc9e8e3a5d8a062646199c63c39dd788d9efb66746e4e75971524c5b7676c69c\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"modality_quote\":\"must\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:6ddc8a4785cbb8fbf5fef6a6a541c8ade6e4e3f80f9be08dd23c67f8f688877b\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(d) The determination of whether an employee meets the hours of service requirement and has been employed by the employer for a total of at least 12 months must be made as of the date the FMLA leave is to start. An employee may be on non-FMLA leave at the time he or she meets the 12-month eligibility requirement, and in that event, any portion of the leave taken for an FMLA-qualifying reason after the employee meets the eligibility requirement would be FMLA leave. See § 825.300(b) for rules governing the content of the eligibility notice given to employees.\",\"references\":[\"§ 825.300(b)\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:49e28e7cd305c39e944a29e995935311d11e941de0e206b5b395f1982d71cc1b\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(d) The determination of whether an employee meets the hours of service requirement and has been employed by the employer for a total of at least 12 months must be made as of the date the FMLA leave is to start. An employee may be on non-FMLA leave at the time he or she meets the 12-month eligibility requirement, and in that event, any portion of the leave taken for an FMLA-qualifying reason after the employee meets the eligibility requirement would be FMLA leave. See § 825.300(b) for rules governing the content of the eligibility notice given to employees.\"],\"scope_text\":\"Determining whether an employee meets the hours of service requirement and the 12-month employment requirement.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":5370,\"summary\":\"The determination of whether an employee meets the hours of service requirement and has been employed by the employer for a total of at least 12 months must be made as of the date the FMLA leave is to start; if an employee is on non-FMLA leave when meeting the 12-month requirement, any portion of the leave taken for an FMLA-qualifying reason thereafter is FMLA leave.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
      "dcterms:references": [
        {
          "@id": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:ac5a4264543fced1dabdf7c37c08e78dd0690b6a7ca554508c3d1f4fe75a1df8"
